
## Rust workspace

The root `Cargo.toml` carries the fuz ecosystem's canonical lints
(`unsafe_code = "forbid"`, clippy pedantic/nursery at warn) and release
profile, with crates under `crates/` (the starter CLI is `crates/__NAME__`)
and the toolchain pinned in `rust-toolchain.toml`. Run cargo directly:

```bash
cargo run -p __NAME__ -- --help
cargo test --workspace
cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
cargo fmt --check
RUSTDOCFLAGS="-D warnings" cargo doc --workspace --no-deps
```

CI runs these in the `rust` job of `.github/workflows/check.yml`. Errors
follow thiserror enums with `.exit_code()`/`.hint()` and
`fn main() -> ExitCode`; exit codes: `0` success, `2` caller-must-fix,
`1` everything else.
